{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Pro Tools-style selection monitor HUD using native gfx (no ReaImGui). Top row : Items count (left) + Tracks count (right) Mid rows : Start / End / Length timecodes (PT transport style) Detail rows: MIDI / Audio / Empty + Channel Count (toggle with arrow / left-click) Right-click: font size (UI scale) / dock / close. Window position, dock state, font size, and panel state persist across restarts.\par}
